{"id": "139937", "name": "מציאת גרעין ותמונה העתקה לינארית - לפי מטריצה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "randvervectnonzero", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[0]),n))"}, {"name": "randhorvect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "matrix(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "dezero", "params": ["vec", "n", "k"], "body": "if (zeromatrixp(vec)) then randvervectnonzero(n,k) else vec"}, {"name": "dezerolst", "params": ["veclst", "k"], "body": "map(lambda([vec], dezero(vec, length(vec),k)), veclst)"}, {"name": "matrify", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "block([mat:matrix([])], for i:1 thru length(veclst) do(mat:addcol(mat,veclst[i])),mat)"}, {"name": "dependentvects", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst))<length(veclst))"}, {"name": "inSpan", "params": ["veclst1", "veclst2"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst1)) = rank(matrify(append(veclst1,veclst2))))"}, {"name": "vectToPoly", "params": ["vect"], "body": "block([poly:0], for i:0 thru (length(vect)-1) do(poly: poly + x^i*vect[i+1,1]),poly)"}, {"name": "polyToVect", "params": ["poly"], "body": "transpose(rest(coeff_list(x^n+poly,x),-1))"}, {"name": "alltrue", "params": ["pred", "lst"], "body": "emptyp(delete(true,map(pred, lst)))"}, {"name": "coin", "params": ["i"], "body": "is(rand(3)=0)", "array": true}, {"name": "inImT", "params": ["v"], "body": "inSpan(cols,[v])"}, {"name": "inKerT", "params": ["v"], "body": "zeromatrixp(TII.v)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\in M_{3\\times 3}(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[A={{CT:0}}\\]</p><p>עבור ההעתקה הלינארית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T_A:\\mathbb{R}^3\\to\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span> המוגדרת על ידי</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[T_A(v)=A\\cdot v\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את הבסיסים הבאים:</p><ul><li>בסיס לתמונה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T_A\\)</span> שנסמנו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_{\\text{Im}}\\)</span>,</li><li>ובסיס לגרעין של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T_A\\)</span> שנסמנו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B_{\\ker}\\)</span>.</li></ul><p>הזינו את הבסיסים כרשימת וקטורי עמודה. שימו לב כי רשימת הוקטורים שאתם מזינים היא <b>בסיס</b> לתת-מרחב המבוקש.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(B_{\\text{Im}}=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-veclist\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: וקטורי עמודה בתוך סוגריים מרובעים, מופרדים בפסיקים. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">[matrix([1],[2],[0]), matrix([0],[1],[3])]</code>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(B_{\\ker}=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הערה: במידה והמרחב הוא הקבוצה של וקטור האפס בלבד, הזינו כבסיס למרחב את הרשימה הריקה: <code dir=\"ltr\">[]</code></p><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הערה: תבנית התשובה שמופיע לא רומזת על מספר הוקטורים בבסיס. אם נדרש, הוסיפו/הורידו וקטורים.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 60, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "[matrix([?],[?],[?]),matrix([?],[?],[?])]", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 60, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "[matrix([", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "[matrix([?],[?],[?]),matrix([?],[?],[?])]", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "if listp(ans1) then anss1:ans1 else anss1:[ans1];\nif listp(ans2) then anss2:ans2 else anss2:[ans2];\nvarlist1: listofvars(anss1);\nvarlist2: listofvars(anss2);\ngoodvars: is((varlist1=[]) and (varlist2 =[]));\n\ngoodcolvect(v):= is(matrixp(v) and (length(v) = n) and (length(transpose(v))=1));\nif alltrue(goodcolvect,anss1) then an1:anss1 else (an1:[], for i:1 while i<=length(anss1) do an1:append(an1,[transpose(anss1[i])]) );\nif alltrue(goodcolvect,anss2) then an2:anss2 else (an2:[], for i:1 while i<=length(anss2) do an2:append(an2,[transpose(anss2[i])]));\ngoodsize: is(alltrue(goodcolvect,an1) and alltrue(goodcolvect,an2));\n\nvalidInput: goodvars and goodsize;\n\nansIm: if (validInput) then an1 else [];\nansKer: if (validInput) then an2 else [];\n\nindIm: not dependentvects(ansIm);\ninspanIm: alltrue(inImT,ansIm);\nspansIm: is(inspanIm and rank(matrify(ansIm))=dimImT);\n\nindKer: not dependentvects(ansKer);\ninspanKer: alltrue(inKerT,ansKer);\nspansKer: is(inspanKer and rank(matrify(ansKer))=dimKerT);\n\ngoodIm: indIm and spansIm;\ngoodKer: indKer and spansKer;\nallgood: is(goodIm and goodKer);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodvars", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">אין להשתמש בתשובתך במשתנים.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodsize", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">לא כל הפריטים ברשימות שהזנת הם וקטורי עמודה בגודל המתאים.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "indIm", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך שגויה. הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Im(T_A)\\)</span> תלויים לינארית.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "inspanIm", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך שגויה. לא כל הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Im(T_A)\\)</span> שייכים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Im(T_A)\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "spansIm", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-5-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-5-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך שגויה. הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Im(T_A)\\)</span> אינם פורשים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Im(T_A)\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 5, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "indKer", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 6, "answernote": "prt1-6-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 6, "answernote": "prt1-6-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך שגויה. הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T_A)\\)</span> תלויים לינארית.</div>"}}, {"name": 6, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "inspanKer", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 7, "answernote": "prt1-7-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 9, "answernote": "prt1-7-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך שגויה. לא כל הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T_A)\\)</span> שייכים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T_A)\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 7, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "spansKer", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 8, "answernote": "prt1-8-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 9, "answernote": "prt1-8-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך שגויה. הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T_A)\\)</span> אינם פורשים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T_A)\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 8, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodKer", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 9, "answernote": "prt1-9-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הזנת בסיס מתאים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Ker(T_A)\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 9, "answernote": "prt1-9-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 9, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "goodIm", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-10-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הזנת בסיס מתאים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Im(T_A)\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-10-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["TII", "cols", "dimImT", "dimKerT", "k", "n"], "nvariants": 50}